<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Mundicenter boosts capital.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Mundicenter boosts capital.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese property developer Mundicenter-Sociedade Imobiliaria SA plans to issue 1.4 million new shares at 1,350 escudos and boost capital by a further 4.05 billion escudos through a scrip issue financed from reserves, Banco Essi said.</p>
<p>The two operations would more than double issued capital to 9.5 billion escudos, it said.</p>
<p>The scrip issue will be 1-for-1, while the 1.4 million share offer will be on the basis of one for every 5.7 shares held.</p>
<p>The period for exercising the rights to the new issue will run from March 31 to April 14.</p>
<p>Mundicenter shares closed 50 escudos higher at 2,250 escudos on Tuesday.</p>
<p>($1=171.3 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
